{"data":{"result":{"callId":"chatcmpl-tool-ad52d1946ec53da2","kind":"tool-result","output":{"content":"# Included Pro usage is now credit\\-based\n\n**Published:** September 9, 2025 | **Authors:** Jas Garcha, Shar Dara, Caleb Boyd, Christian Pickett, Blake Mealey, George Karagkiaouris, Shu Uesugi, Dan Fein, Christopher Skillicorn, Michael Wenzel, Bryan Mishkin, Jeff Pope, Gary Tyr, Suyog Rao\n\n---\n\nThe Pro plan now includes $20 in monthly usage credit instead of fixed allocations across metrics like data transfer, compute, caching, and more. This plan update replaces static usage buckets with a more flexible system that adapts to your workload.\n\nIn addition to the above, the new Pro pricing model includes:\n\n- [**Free viewer seats**](https://vercel.com/changelog/free-viewer-seats-now-available-on-pro)\n- **Self-serve enterprise features like **[**SAML SSO**](https://vercel.com/changelog/saml-sso-is-now-available-to-pro-teams)** and **[**HIPAA BAA**](https://vercel.com/changelog/hipaa-baas-are-now-available-to-pro-teams)\n- [**Better Spend Management, enabled by default**](https://vercel.com/changelog/spend-management-now-enabled-by-default-on-pro)\n\nRead more about the [updates to Pro](https://vercel.com/blog/new-pro-pricing-plan) and [switch to the new Pro pricing](https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fsettings%2Fbilling&title=Switch+to+new+Pro+pricing).\n\n**A more flexible Pro plan.**\nStart building with the new Pro plan today. Flexible credits, free viewer seats, and enterprise-grade features now available.\n[Read more](https://vercel.com/blog/new-pro-pricing-plan)\n\n---\n\n📚 **More updates:** [View all changelog entries](/changelog/sitemap.md) | [Blog](/blog/sitemap.md)","contentType":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8","truncated":false,"url":"https://vercel.com/changelog/included-pro-usage-is-now-credit-based"},"toolName":"web_fetch"},"sequence":0,"stepIndex":8,"status":"completed","turnId":"turn_0"},"type":"action.result","meta":{"at":"2026-06-18T15:56:49.585Z"}}
