{"data":{"result":{"callId":"chatcmpl-tool-9c234416d3dca998","kind":"tool-result","output":{"content":"# Vercel KV is now generally available for Hobby and Pro customers\n\n**Published:** June 15, 2023 | **Authors:** Adrian Cooney, Fabio Benedetti, Edward Thomson, Dom Busser\n\n---\n\n> **Note:** The Vercel KV product has been sunset. You can now deploy alternative KV stores and other storage solutions through the [Vercel Marketplace Storage](https://vercel.com/marketplace/category/storage?category=storage&search=redis), with automatic account provisioning and unified billing. [Learn more](https://vercel.com/blog/introducing-the-vercel-marketplace).\n\n[Vercel KV](https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-kv), our durable Redis database that enables you to store and retrieve JSON data, is now generally available.\n\nThis feature is available for Hobby and Pro users with Hobby users getting 1 Database, 30,000 requests per month, 256 MB total storage, and 256 MB data transfer per month. Pro users will get 1 Database, 150,000 requests per month, 512 MB total storage, 512 MB data transfer per month. **Billing will begin on June 20th. **\n\nOn-demand pricing for Pro users has also been lowered, with total storage **reduced 17% from $0.30/GB to $0.25/GB **and** **data transfer **reduced 50% from $0.20/GB to $0.10/GB. **\n\nTo see your usage, visit the the [Usage page](https://vercel.com/dashboard/usage) in the Dashboard. If you want to stop leveraging Vercel KV or see how to optimize your usage, you can [stop querying the database and delete it](https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-kv/usage-and-pricing#managing-charges).\n\nIf you're an Enterprise company interested in using Vercel KV, you can [contact us](https://vercel.com/contact/sales) to get started.\n\n[Check out the documentation](https://vercel.com/docs/storage/vercel-kv) to learn more about Vercel KV.\n\n---\n\n📚 **More updates:** [View all changelog entries](/changelog/sitemap.md) | [Blog](/blog/sitemap.md)","contentType":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8","truncated":false,"url":"https://vercel.com/changelog/vercel-kv-is-now-generally-available"},"toolName":"web_fetch"},"sequence":0,"stepIndex":16,"status":"completed","turnId":"turn_0"},"type":"action.result","meta":{"at":"2026-06-18T15:57:52.590Z"}}
