Netlify\n\n#### Key Moves (last 7 days)\n- **June 9 2026 – Netlify added to the **Cursor marketplace** **  \n  - Developers can now connect their AI‑assisted coding environment (Cursor) directly to Netlify for one‑click deploys, reducing context switches.  \n  - [netlify.com/changelog/2026-06-09-netlify-cursor-marketplace/](https://www.netlify.com/changelog/2026-06-09-netlify-cursor-market","sequence":0,"stepIndex":18,"turnId":"turn_0"},"type":"message.appended","meta":{"at":"2026-06-18T15:58:26.864Z"}}
