ss for our own plans. | Set a watch for Vercel’s changelog or community posts for any late‑week pricing updates. |\n| Netlify","sequence":0,"stepIndex":18,"turnId":"turn_0"},"type":"message.appended","meta":{"at":"2026-06-18T15:58:36.683Z"}}
