ss for our own plans. | Set a watch for Vercel’s changelog or community posts for any late‑week pricing updates. |\n| Netlify – post‑June 9 pricing announcements (e.g., credit limits, usage alerts) | Pricing shifts could change the value proposition for our target customers. | Monitor Netlify’s pricing page and change‑log for","sequence":0,"stepIndex":18,"turnId":"turn_0"},"type":"message.appended","meta":{"at":"2026-06-18T15:58:37.510Z"}}
